cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the Dravix software record and, for data, the benchmark dataset record."
type: software
title: "Dravix engine: materials fire-risk screening API and demo interface"
repository-code: "https://github.com/nikhilesh-s/dravix-engine"
url: "https://dravix-engine.materiamse.com"
